                <pb facs="0578" n="466" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg466"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Sherrill to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-06-03"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 3,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your June 1–2. Argentine minister for foreign affairs is in complete accord with
                    you.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherrill.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
